+stripped first, junk after a closing quote or a stray `"`/`\r`/`\n` = error)
+and compared `parseCsvLine` to it, also asserting the result is a plain
+`Array` (prototype `Array.prototype`) of primitive strings and that anything
+thrown is `instanceof CsvError && instanceof Error`.
+
+- Exhaustive: every string of length 0-8 over the alphabet
+  `" , \n \r a space` (2 015 539 strings). 0 mismatches.
+- Random: 300 000 strings of length 0-47 over a 35-symbol alphabet weighted
+  toward `"`, `,`, `\n`, `\r` and including `\t`, NUL, `\x7f`, `\u0085`,
+  ` `, ` `, ` `, BOM `﻿`, `é`, an astral emoji, lone
+  high and low surrogates, curly quotes `“ ”`, full-width `＂` and `，`,
+  backslash, `\v`, `\f`, `\x1c`-`\x1e`. 0 mismatches.
